{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipe Down is a puzzle game centered around pipes. It is mainly inspired by the old pipe puzzle games. Powered by the Godot engine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipe Down has four distinct mods to keep players engaged and always on their toes when trying to complete puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode is the standard pipe puzzle mode. The player is tasked with trying to get enough points by combining random pipe pieces into one continuous pipe for the water to flow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle mode is a logic pipe puzzle mode where your objective is to combine all of the pipes together to make a singular pipe with ends to form a closed loop.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap mode tasks the player with connecting two pieces of pipe on the opposite side of the level together. the player can only use the pipe pieces found within the level and can only swap out pieces to form one singular connecting pipe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless is classic game mode but once you beat a level you keep going as long as you can to see how long of a streak you can get.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These modes will challenge players in various ways and will require the player to change their strategies depending on the mode.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"PLAY CLASSIC 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875650/e432412bb2bf75cd35533551a1057b7de7d77c54.jpg"},{"name":"PLAY CLASSIC 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875650/e432412bb2bf75cd35533551a1057b7de7d77c54.jpg"},{"name":"PLAY CLASSIC 25","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875650/e432412bb2bf75cd35533551a1057b7de7d77c54.jpg"},{"name":"PLAY CLASSIC 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875650/5050159a0236378ca36df5c0a5c3b2313aca3